BTC TRADING PLATFORM — INSTITUTIONAL ARCHITECT REVIEW
Classification: Internal Audit | Date: 2026-05-31 | Panel: Principal Quant, HFT Infra, Security, Risk, DB, Go, Next.js, Systems Architect

EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
This platform is a sophisticated multi-market algorithmic trading system with genuine architectural ambition. The research tournament, multi-model AI consensus, and 100+ strategy registry demonstrate real engineering depth. However, the system has critical live-deployment blockers — exposed API keys in source, no authentication on the Go engine, a free-tier AI council with 4.2-second throttling that structurally prevents scalping, and a backtest engine that models only half of real execution costs.

The platform is not production-ready in its current state. With 4–6 weeks of targeted hardening, it could reach institutional small-fund deployment readiness.

