From engine/internal/ai/agents.go:


// Line 345 — Free tier throttle
time.Sleep(4200 * time.Millisecond)
This single line is the most damaging performance constraint in the system. The free-tier AI model chain has a mandatory 4.2-second sleep between audit calls. For a 1-minute scalping system, this means:

